# The Raccoon: Thanksgiving's Rusher, as the beetle is Halloween's. Low and
# four-legged, charging straight for the bird: a bandit mask with white eyes,
# a pale muzzle, round ears, and a ringed tail held up behind.
size 7 7 9
voxel 0.1
colors
  P purple
  d purpleDark
  l purpleLight
  w white
  k ink
# Legs.
box 1 0 2 1 1 2 d
box 5 0 2 5 1 2 d
box 1 0 6 1 1 6 d
box 5 0 6 5 1 6 d
# Body.
box 1 2 2 5 4 7 P
# Head: muzzle, nose, the mask and its eyes, ears.
box 1 2 0 5 5 2 P
box 2 2 0 4 3 0 l
box 3 3 0 3 3 0 k
box 1 4 0 5 4 0 k
box 2 4 0 2 4 0 w
box 4 4 0 4 4 0 w
box 1 6 1 1 6 2 d
box 5 6 1 5 6 2 d
# The ringed tail, up behind.
box 3 3 8 3 3 8 d
box 3 4 8 3 4 8 P
box 3 5 8 3 5 8 d
box 3 6 8 3 6 8 P
